  decisions: 00000000000000000000000007000000000000000000000000000000
  altLinesOne:
  - '*Might as well take it if it''s just sitting there.*'
  - '[1 supplies gained]'
  - '*After all, I might need it. I''ll be driving through the forest tomorrow.*'
  altLinesTwo:
  - '*I might as well put some there for the next per-*'
  - '*Oh, wait. I don''t exactly have much of anything to offer, do I?*'
  - '*I uh, think I''ll just go to sleep now...*'
